machine corridor/ab
  states
    sealed
    open

  transition crossFromA()
    sealed -> open
    guard room/a `cleared` mark/yes
    assert self `cleared` mark/yes
    assert room/b `cleared` mark/yes
    assert self `state` open
    retract self `state`

  transition crossFromB()
    sealed -> open
    guard room/b `cleared` mark/yes
    assert self `cleared` mark/yes
    assert room/a `cleared` mark/yes
    assert self `state` open
    retract self `state`

